# Code owners for security-sensitive paths (OpenSSF Scorecard: Code-Review /
# Branch-Protection; NIST SSDF PO.2 roles, PW.7 review). With "Require review
# from Code Owners" enabled on the main branch protection rule, a change to any
# path below needs an approval from the security reviewers.
#
# PLACEHOLDER: @mliad313sn/security-reviewers does not exist yet. Before the
# public release, create the team (or replace it with named maintainers) and
# give it write access, otherwise GitHub reports these rules as invalid.
# Later rules win: keep the most specific paths at the bottom.

